{
  "name": "Trellis: Hourly PostHog Snapshot Refresh",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "5 * * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Hourly at :05",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [240, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://YOUR_HUB_PROJECT.supabase.co/functions/v1/posthog-refresh",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={}",
        "options": {
          "response": { "response": { "neverError": false, "responseFormat": "json" } }
        }
      },
      "name": "Refresh All PostHog Snapshots",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [500, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Required credential\n\nOn the HTTP node, create an **HTTP Header Auth** credential:\n\n- Name: `x-trellis-refresh-secret`\n- Value: the same random value deployed as the Supabase `POSTHOG_REFRESH_SECRET` secret\n\nUpdate `YOUR_HUB_PROJECT` before activation. Deploy `posthog-refresh` with `--no-verify-jwt`; it authenticates the request with this secret, then calls the JWT-protected analytics function internally with the Hub service role. The workflow refreshes 7-, 30-, and 90-day snapshots for every connected project at five minutes past each hour.",
        "width": 620,
        "height": 360
      },
      "name": "Setup and Security Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [80, -180]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Hourly at :05": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Refresh All PostHog Snapshots", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  }
}
